[en.FOCUS_C18_111_QIAN]
Qian

[en.FOCUS_C18_111_QIAN_desc]
Qian, the leader, a strong and resolute one who follows the mandate of heaven. The sky is always changing, like the sun and the moon running in circles, never stopping. Just like every cycle of the sun and the moon is a new day, the cycle of Kirin is not static, but an eternal progress.\nSince the decision of opening up, the Kirins have been thinking like spring water, absorbing new knowledge in the exchanges with the outside world and emerging our own creativity. The Kirins, once seen as antiques, have now given birth to a new generation of scholars who are at the forefront of magic and science.\nAlthough it is unknown where those creative inspirations and genius minds come from, under the encouragement and leadership of Autumn Blaze, the Kirins will continue to explore new frontiers, both in reality and on the path of §Cresearch§!.\nBut be aware that the purest Yang is always fragile and restless, which means excessive perfection may contain lurking crises. What will the crisis be? All we can do is to follow the mandate of heaven.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_111_QIAN]
乾

[zh.FOCUS_C18_111_QIAN_desc]
乾为君，刚健的领导者顺乎天命。天恒变，如日月运行周而复始永不停止。而正如每一个日月轮回都是新的一天，麒麟国的轮回也并非静止不动，而是在永恒的进步之中。\n自从决定开放以来，麒麟族才思如泉涌，在外界的交流中，他们不断地吸取新的知识，并涌现新的创意。曾经被看做是古董的麒麟们如今也诞生出了走在魔法与科学前沿的新一代学者。\n虽然不知道那些创意灵感和天才头脑来自于何处，但在秋烨的鼓励和领导下，麒麟们将不断探索新的边疆，无论是现实中，还是在§C研究§!的道路上。\n不过要注意纯阳易折欠安，过分的圆满也许潜藏着危机。危机将是什么？我们能做的只有顺乎天命。

